    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Apr 2025 12:34:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>什么是黑色？</span></p><p><span>这个问题一定要用眼睛看后才能回答吗？</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680c98bc8aed253fa39e71be?s=eyJ1IjoiNjEwZTYxYjRlMGY1ZTcyM2JiMWIzZjEwIn0%3D" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680c98bc8aed253fa39e71be?s=eyJ1IjoiNjEwZTYxYjRlMGY1ZTcyM2JiMWIzZjEwIn0%3D"><strong><span>Orpheus微见：人为什么怕黑？如何跳出非黑即白的内耗？</span></strong></a></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkqDamCvc6nFTErzkKGzE0ohreBy.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1">00:01</a> </span><strong><span>Sur l'océan couleur de fer</span></strong><span> (在铁色的海面上) - Alcest</span></p><p><span>Blackgaze / Post Black Metal</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">08:10</a></span><strong><span> Planet Caravan </span></strong><span>- Black Sabbath</span></p><p><span>Psychedelic Rock</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="762">12:42</a> </span><strong><span>Wo Sich Fuchs undHase gute Nacht sagen</span></strong><span> (在狐狸和兔子互道晚安的地方) - Sangre De Muerdago</span></p><p><span>Folk</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1035">17:15</a> </span><strong><span>Een Stemme Locker</span></strong><span> - Ulver</span></p><p><span>Black Metal / Dark Folk</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1272">21:12</a> </span><strong><span>Shadowplay</span></strong><span> - Joy Division</span></p><p><span>Post Punk</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> </span><strong><span>Black Stone Heart </span></strong><span>- Bauhaus</span></p><p><span>Post Punk</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a> </span><strong><span>East Hastings </span></strong><span>- Godspeed You! Black Emperor</span></p><p><span>Post Rock</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2376">39:36</a></span><strong><span> Мёртвая луна</span></strong><span> (死月) - IC3PEAK</span></p><p><span>Dark Trap</span></p><p><span><a class="times