  <item>
    <title>008-必有回响</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67277feccbe0e69c8bc9568d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67277feccbe0e69c8bc9568d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 04 Nov 2024 05:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>如何判断自己是否活在真实的世界中？</span></p><span></span><p><span>发出声音、做出行动和探索</span></p><span></span><p><span>就一定会不断收到</span></p><span></span><p><span>意想不到的回响</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6724c9d9cbe0e69c8b67ecf0" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6724c9d9cbe0e69c8b67ecf0"><span>在微见收听这些音乐背后的完整故事</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6724c9d9cbe0e69c8b67ecf0" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6724c9d9cbe0e69c8b67ecf0"><span>以及我在日本的诸多遭遇</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqiVM4E_21Oo8HMVGtNeJFXAi-ou.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1">0:01</a> </span><strong><span>Intro / Tokyo</span></strong><span> - Lost in Translation</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">0:34</a> </span><strong><span>Strip It Down</span></strong><span> - Manic Street Preachers</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>在Umeda Trad Livehouse门口看到乐迷排队时听到的歌</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="177">2:57</a> </span><strong><span>此岸御詠歌</span></strong><span> - 人間椅子</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>2023.10.19人间椅子巡演大阪站开场曲</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">5:18</a></span><strong><span> 星空の導き</span></strong><span> - 人間椅子</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>现场听哭的一首歌，和嶋慎治写给他去世的朋友，他想象每一个离去的亲人或朋友，都会变成天上的星星，在黑暗中照亮我们人生的前路。我突然顿悟，臆想和信念的区别，仅仅是它能不能引着我穿越黑暗和迷茫，达到我们的目标。</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">10:15</a> </span><strong><span>Dot Dash</span></strong><span> - Wire</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>在英国时很喜欢的英国朋克，在大阪的Time Bomb唱片店听到</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="983">16:23</a> </span><strong><span>諦念プシガンガ</span></strong><span> - 戸川純</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>在东京高円寺卡拉OK里唱的歌</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1018">16:58</a> </span><strong><span>風をあつめて</span></strong><span> - Happy End</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>《迷失东京》里卡拉OK包厢里传出的歌声</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1259">20:59</a> </span><strong><span>日语Rap 佚名</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>东京下北泽中古服装店里播放的音乐</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1323">22:03</a> </span><strong><span>島唄</span></strong><span> - Nanase和々世翻唱</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>高中时很喜欢的一首歌，由THE BOOM到冲绳采风时创作</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1454">24:14</a> </span><strong><span>那霸洒水车播放的音乐片段</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1478">24:38</a> </span><strong><span>琉球三味线弹唱民谣</span></strong><span> - 比嘉いづみ</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>福州园内不期而遇的歌声和对话</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1701">28:21</a> </span><strong><span>Ikebana 花火</span></strong><span> - Kevin Shields</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1789">29:49</a> </span><strong><span>美しいこと</span></strong><span> - AJICO</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>THE END</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐播客「声音切片」</span></p><span></span><p><span>是</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/629c8d615592c955700e7f87" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/629c8d615592c955700e7f87"><span>「Orpheus微见」</span></a><span>的B-Sides</span></p><span></span><p><span>这里无需观点 专注音乐本身</span></p><span></span><p><span>联结那些被大众传媒和算法推荐遗漏的切片</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起听见声音的更多可能性</span></p>]]></description>
