    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在丰饶的地中海和刚果雨林之间</span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么造物者会在这里创造一个无边的撒哈拉</span></p><span></span><p><span>但寸草不生的沙漠中</span></p><span></span><p><span>也能生长出独属于这里的音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>就像在沙漠的尽头</span></p><span></span><p><span>总会有绿洲或海洋</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpDhRRtdPAIGfWdap_yFlYsjz8d-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1">00:01</a> باب البلو · إلى متى</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Ila Mata（直到现在） &nbsp;- Bab L' Bluz</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>摩洛哥 格纳瓦融合音乐 迷幻摇滚 ▼</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv351ueYwInq2OTDNu3ZB3_s5MED.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="259">04:19</a> موسيقى الشارع في مدينة الصويرة</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Essaouira街头音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>摩洛哥 格纳瓦融合音乐</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="474">07:54</a> ⵜⵏⵔⵓⵏ - ⵙⴰⵙⵜⴰⵏⴰⵇⵇⴰⵎ</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Sastanàqqàm（我问你） - Tinariwen</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>马里 图阿雷格音乐 沙漠蓝调 ▼</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn9y5yjXY4yKBE_02NPB33s5swBy.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> ⵜⵏⵔⵓⵏ &nbsp;- ⵛⵀⴻⵜ ⴱⵓⵖⴰⵙⵙⴰ</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Chet Boghassa（相聚在博哈萨） - Tinariwen</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>马里 图阿雷格音乐 沙漠蓝调</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="942">15:42</a> ⵎⴷⵓ ⵎⵓⴽⵜⴰⵔ - ⵉⵎⵓⵀⴰⵔ</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Imouhar（哥们儿） - Mdou Moctar</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>尼日尔 图阿雷格音乐 沙漠蓝调 ▼</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llAXOm6dW6xkCkdFMS73OAUcDK1A.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1209">20:09</a> ⴰⵍⵉ ⴼⴰⵔⴽⴰ ⵜⵓⵔ - ⴳⵓⵢ ⴽⵓⵔ</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Goye Kur - Ali Farka Touré</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>马里 图阿雷格音乐 沙漠蓝调 ▼</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq7ru-KNSK9bRpm5jhr7UwBBqzeN.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1460">24:20</a> ⴱⵓⵎⴱⵉⵏⵓ - ⵜⵏⵔ</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Tenere（沙漠 我的家） - Bombino</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>尼日尔 图阿雷格音乐 沙漠蓝调</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1669">27:49</a> ⴼⴰⵜⵓ ⵙⴻⵉⴷⵉ ⴳⴰⵍⵉ - ⵜⴻⵍⵉⵍⵉⵜ</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Telilit - Fatou Seidi Ghali</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>尼日尔 图阿雷格音乐 ▼</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgPYQMP4TcVYi4FnoihHRABDQWAY.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1983">33:03</a> قد أج أسد &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;الموسيقى التصويرية</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>即兴音乐 &nbsp;Kedou ag Ossad</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>利比亚 &nbsp;图阿雷格音乐</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1992">33:12</a> أقزام شرق العجوزة &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;شاشين نظيف</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Clean Shashin（明月）- The dwarfs of east Agouza</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>埃及 迷幻摇滚 &nbsp;自由爵士 ▼</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjq0kBLx6r_eLqTEXY0W5dp2qSDR.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐播客「声音切片」</span></p><span></span><p><span>是</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/629c8d615592c955700e7f87" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/629c8d615592c955700e7f87"><span>「Orpheus微见」</span></a><span>的B-Sides</span></p><span></span><p><span>这里无需观点 专注音乐本身</span></p><span></span><p><span>联结那些被大众传媒和算法推荐遗漏的切片</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起听见声音的更多可能性</span></