  <item>
    <title>005-夏日海风</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64bf85b7e8176c3ff8a2f460</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64bf85b7e8176c3ff8a2f460</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Jul 2023 08:20:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>夏天</span></p><span></span><p><span>可能是感官和联觉体验最丰富的季节</span></p><span></span><p><span>西瓜味、空调风</span></p><span></span><p><span>游泳池里的浪花声和消毒水的气味……</span></p><span></span><p><span>而那些生长在海边、全年饱食阳光与海风的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>是不是连他们的语言、旋律和基因中</span></p><span></span><p><span>都天生自带夏日的浪漫、热情与无忧无虑？</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天，我们一起横跨太平洋</span></p><span></span><p><span>听听海风和洋流如何带着音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>一路漂洋过海、一路演化、一路播撒下不同的浪漫</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家在这个夏天尽享悠闲，收获更多新感受</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>【微见&amp;声音切片福利】评论分享你对夏天印象最深的感官体验，7月30日选最高赞听友送一箱我爱喝的 椰子水（不是广告）</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Foq99RvNMVt1G6D12FEM-4zDnCUm.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8">00:08</a> 風をあつめて - Happy End 日本 民谣摇滚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="256">04:16</a> That Summer Feeling - Roly Poly Rag Bear 日本 独立流行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">06:50</a> 恋ぬ初み - 古謝美佐子 冲绳群岛 民谣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="636">10:36</a> 南海姑娘 - 邓丽君 中国台湾 流行（刘惜君翻唱）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="895">14:55</a> Rasa Sayange - 马来民谣 马来群岛 （Deredia翻唱）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1051">17:31</a> Green Island Song - Ontar Sunshine 瓦努阿图 民谣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1176">19:36</a> Aloha 'Oe - Lili'uokalani 夏威夷群岛 Mike Holland翻奏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1326">22:06</a> Your Summer Dream - The Beach Boys 美国加州 冲浪摇滚 迷幻摇滚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1477">24:37</a> Galápagos Local Music - 加拉帕戈斯群岛 民谣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1636">27:16</a> Summertime - Ray Barretto 古巴 古巴爵士</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1814">30:14</a> The Girl From Ipanema - João Gilberto 巴西 巴西爵士 Jonny Hepbir Quartet翻唱</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>相关节目：</span></strong></p><span></span><h1><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62a0d425b32f552f54730e20" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62a0d425b32f552f54730e20"><span>音乐口味受先天影响？揭开声音的深层文化结构</span></a></h1><span></span><p><span>音乐播客「声音切片」</span></p><span></span><p><span>是</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/629c8d615592c955700e7f87" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/629c8d615592c955700e7f87"><span>「Orpheus微见」</span></a><span>的B-Sides</span></p><span></span><p><span>这里无需观点 专注音乐本身</span></p><span></span><p><span>联结那些被大众传媒和算法推荐遗漏的切片</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起听见声音的更多可能性</span></p>]]></description>
