    <pubDate>Sat, 01 Jul 2023 18:02:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这会儿正担心怎么还睡不着吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>想更快入睡 睡得更踏实吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>那这期应该值得收藏和反复收听</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论噪音还是音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们都已经掌握了</span></p><span></span><p><span>让它听起来更放松安眠的秘密</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>相关节目：</span></strong></p><span></span><h1><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6495c04d86eb9d7e470840e5" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6495c04d86eb9d7e470840e5"><span>如何让噪音变好听？重新发明最催眠的声音</span></a></h1><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Js411w7Rm/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Js411w7Rm/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click"><span>纪录片《Beautiful Noise 美丽噪音》</span></a></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>PART1 乐</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4">00:04</a> Gymnopedies 1 (Remixed-雨天) - Erik Satie</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="188">03:08</a> 雨音 - Tsuki No Wa</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="555">09:15</a> ? - 四人囃子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="681">11:21</a> Menuet sur le nom d'Haydn - Maurice Ravel</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="785">13:05</a> Sigur Rós - All alright</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1165">19:25</a> Cello Suite No.1 in G Major (Remixed-微风) - Bach</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1327">22:07</a> Peace - A Theme &amp; An End - King Crimson</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1524">25:24</a> I Talk to the Wind - King Crimson</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1886">31:26</a> Yesterday And Today - Yes</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2081">34:41</a> haunt me (×3