    <title>003-重复之美</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/648565f56752b5f9de72e026</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">648565f56752b5f9de72e026</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Jun 2023 06:13:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>微见一周年节目中</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们特别聊到</span><strong><span>「重复」</span></strong><span>这一话题</span></p><span></span><p><span>重复是一种存在于万事万物之中的基本规律</span></p><span></span><p><span>尤其突出在音乐和建筑设计这两类艺术创作中</span></p><span></span><p><span>但世上也没有绝对的重复</span></p><span></span><p><span>每一次重复又在创造着新的差异</span></p><span></span><p><span>「一花一世界」</span></p><span></span><p><span>重复 通过差异 来一次次地证明</span></p><span></span><p><span>重复的力量</span></p><span></span><p><span>而音乐也似乎就是一种</span></p><span></span><p><span>利用重复创造预期</span></p><span></span><p><span>和打破预期的艺术</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>相关节目：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6482ac8253a5e5ea144308b9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6482ac8253a5e5ea144308b9"><span>如何在重复性工作中反抗虚无、创造新价值？| 微见一周年×在场证明</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63de264de99bdef7d300916d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63de264de99bdef7d300916d"><span>音乐为什么好听？</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4">00:04</a> Aururain Dance - Nujabes 日本 Jazzy-Hiphop 利用大量爵士采样循环重复</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="246">04:06</a> Dipped in Folly - pracs 英国 电子音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="411">06:51</a> Frere Jacques a cappella (节选) - Mundwerk无伴奏人声合 完全使用复调中的</span><strong><span>轮唱</span></strong><span>形式演唱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="484">08:04</a> Discipline - King Crimson 英国 前卫摇滚 不同乐器演奏分别采用了</span><strong><span>5拍</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>17拍</span></strong><span>等特殊节奏型，并使用了</span><strong><span>位移重复 (模进)</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="784">13:04</a> Breadcrumb Trail - Slint 美国 后摇滚/数学摇滚 采用了</span><strong><span>7拍</span></strong><span>等特殊节奏型</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1132">18:52</a> Trailer 5 - World's End Girlfriend+MONO 日本 后摇滚 重复+变奏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2283">38:03</a> Lateralus - Tool 美国 前卫金属 利用</span><strong><span>斐波那契数列</span></strong><span>概念进行创作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2842">47:22</a> Sonata No.4 in E Minor, BWV528 - 巴赫 古典 巴洛克 </span><strong><span>复调</span></strong><span>音乐 管风琴演奏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3172">52:52</a> Pink Lady Lemonade - Acid Mother Temple 日本 迷幻摇滚 重复+变奏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3499">58:19</a> Music for Mallet Instruments, Voices &amp; Organ - Steve Reich 美国 </span><strong><span>极简主义</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4504">1:15:04</a> Walk of Life - Dire Straits 英国 摇滚 本曲前奏连复段在整首歌中几乎完全重复</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhYkrT7Mv_pUF5mI6pAykg03jgKl.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>音乐播客「声音切片」</span></p><span></span><p><span>是</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/629c8d615592c955700e7f87" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/629c8d615592c955700e7f87"><strong><span>「Orpheus微见」</span></strong></a><span>的B-Sides</span></p><span></span><p><span>这里无需观点 专注音乐本身</span></p><span></span><p><span>联结那些被大众传媒和算法推荐遗漏的切片</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起听见声音的更多可能性</span></p>]]></description>
