  <item>
    <title>002-光怪陆离</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/647ac2e953a5e5ea14c750ed</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">647ac2e953a5e5ea14c750ed</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 03 Jun 2023 04:34:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>有一种听感很光怪陆离的融合风格</span></p><span></span><p><span>似乎很少被正式提及</span></p><span></span><p><span>大多只传于乐迷口中</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「重迷幻 Heavy Psychedelic」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>被主流乐评拆解得七零八碎</span></p><span></span><p><span>重金属 Heavy Metal / 迷幻摇滚 Psychedelic Rock / 酸性摇滚 Acid Rock / 前卫摇滚 Progressive Rock / 石人 Stoner / 泥浆金属 Sludge Metal / 末日金属 Doom Metal / 太空摇滚 Space Rock……</span></p><span></span><p><span>似乎都与重迷幻有很相似的听感和渊源</span></p><span></span><p><span>在溯源中</span></p><span></span><p><span>我发现早期重金属/迷幻/前卫摇滚</span></p><span></span><p><span>并没有很明显的人为区隔</span></p><span></span><p><span>不过回到创作者的意图</span></p><span></span><p><span>是先有风格 还是先有作品？</span></p><span></span><p><span>是其他风格融合成了重迷幻 还是重迷幻影响了其他风格？</span></p><span></span><p><span>风格好像一点都不重要了</span></p><span></span><p><span>但背后光怪陆离的发展走势和渊源</span></p><span></span><p><span>却难以被隐藏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4">00:04</a> The Place You Walk (2015) - Jex Thoth</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> You Can Prove Them Wrong (2015) - Arabs in Aspic</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="536">08:56</a> Death Warmed Up (1969) - High Tide</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1084">18:04</a> Rape of the Locks (1971)[Remixed] - Budgie</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1406">23:26</a> Everything in My Heart (1971)[Bonus Track] - Budgie</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1459">24:19</a> Daystar (1968) - S.R.C</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1724">28:44</a> Wilted Flower (2022) - Nebula</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2010">33:30</a> La Verdad (2017) - Humanotone</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2277">37:57</a> Chance (2013) - Bardo Pond</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkBi-aR5vmnwr-h3wCmgS5VfxcF8.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>音乐播客「声音切片」</span></p><span></span><p><span>是</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/629c8d615592c955700e7f87" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/629c8d615592c955700e7f87"><strong><span>「Orpheus微见」</span></strong></a><span>的B-Sides</span></p><span></span><p><span>这里无需观点 专注音乐本身</span></p><span></span><p><span>联结那些被大众传媒和算法推荐遗漏的切片</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起听见声音的更多可能性</span></p>]]></description>
