    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>如何用语言描述和定义「爵士乐」？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我想没有谁可以做到</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为它的内涵和外延每时每刻都正在发生变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> Song for Valentin - Garizim（瑞典 含绞弦琴演奏）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a> Lounging There Trying - Hatfield And the North（英国 前卫摇滚）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="573">09:33</a> Taksim Dream - Dzambo Agusevi（土耳其 民族&amp;融合爵士）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="812">13:32</a> 酒狂（Vinnie Rose翻奏）- 阮籍（中国晋朝 原曲为古琴作曲）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1314">21:54</a> Buendia - &nbsp;四人囃子（日本 前卫摇滚）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1622">27:02</a> Balawan Gamelan Fusion - Bangkyang Ngegol（印尼爪哇 甘美兰乐器）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2270">37:50</a> Ac Recoletos Jazz - Caramelo de Cuba（古巴 含古巴康加鼓Congas演奏）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2653">44:13</a> Physical Education（Metaphump翻奏）- Animals as Leaders（美国 前卫金属）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2994">49:54</a> Sin Nada - Sintesis（阿根廷 前卫摇滚）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FojZsshTPMVzaMYwm13ZMX7WCPp7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>音乐播客「声音切片」</span></p><span></span><p><span>是</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/629c8d615592c955700e7f87" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/629c8d615592c955700e7f87"><strong><span>「Orpheus微见」</span></strong></a><span>的B-Sides</span></p><span></span><p><span>这里无需观点 专注音乐本身</span></p><span></span><p><span>联结那些被大众传媒和算法推荐遗漏的切片</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起听见声音的更多可能性</span></p>]]></description>
